OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly, locally misty
OL,6,Fstart Thursday morning looks fine with
OL,7,Flight winds and plenty of warm hazy
OL,8,Fsunshine. However, cloud will slowly
OL,9,Fbegin to increase from the west during
OL,10,Fthe afternoon as a southerly breeze
OL,11,Fdevelops.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a mostly dry,
OL,14,Fthough increasingly cloudy and breezy
OL,15,Fevening. Some rain will arrive from
OL,16,Fthe northwest overnight, with hill fog
OL,17,Fforming as the winds fall light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
