OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FFriday looks rather cloudy
OL,6,Fwith some outbreaks of mostly light
OL,7,Fand fairly patchy rain. Hill fog
OL,8,Fgradually lifting though, and possibly
OL,9,Fturning a little brighter in the north
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThe
OL,13,Fweekend will bring some pleasant
OL,14,Fspells of sunshine and just a few
OL,15,Fshowers. Mostly dry on Monday with
OL,16,Ffurther sunny spells, though perhaps
OL,17,Fturning breezy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
